# The Temple of Desolation (Zilart 10), current. Lower Jeuno's Aldo plays 24; Norg's _700 plays 5 (ReplaceDefault, over
# Norg's DefaultActions DOOR_IS_LOCKED), Gilgamesh 10 and Kamui 11 (over Kamui's DefaultActions 61); the Hall of the
# Gods' _6z0 plays the mission's progress 1 (over the NPC's own 1), whose finish completes the mission (The Hall of the
# Gods next, the Sealer of the Portal of the Gods title). The next _6z0 is The Hall of the Gods' DEPRESSION_A_CLUE.
lists LowerJeuno/Aldo/onTrigger Norg/_700/onTrigger Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger Norg/Kamui/onTrigger HallOfTheGods/_6z0/onTrigger HallOfTheGods/onEventFinish/1
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=23,3,-58 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheTempleOfDesolation current
login
trigger Aldo                            # 24
finish
warp 98,-7,-12 Norg
trigger _700                            # 5
finish
trigger Gilgamesh                       # 10
finish
trigger Kamui                           # 11
finish
warp 0,-14,46 HallOfTheGods
trigger _6z0                            # 1
finish                                  # completed
trigger _6z0                            # The Hall of the Gods current: its DEPRESSION_A_CLUE
finish-if-event
